@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Login - student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "USE_VALUE_FROM_YOUR_LAB_CONFIG"
}

### Login - admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "USE_VALUE_FROM_YOUR_LAB_CONFIG"
}

### Profil bez tokenu -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile

### Profil z tokenem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Lista tematów - publiczna
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics

### Dodanie - wymaga uwierzytelnienia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/topics
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Authorization"
}

### Usunięcie - wymaga Admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
